  "id": "teaching-style",
  "term": "teaching style",
  "definition": "Teaching style is the way students experience a teacher’s instructional behavior, which can be more supportive and motivating or more controlling and demotivating. In this context, it is linked to students’ motivation partly through how it affects their feelings of autonomy, competence, and relatedness.",
